{
    "name": "dsh-wifi-access",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "HOST 侧移动端访问兜底（DSH 插件）：内置 WiFi 反代 0.0.0.0:3081 → 127.0.0.1:3080，Host/Origin 改写回 loopback，裸导航 401 自动 302 换 token；与 dsh-pocket 互为热备（每 20s 复探，对方掉线就自己接管），另提供华为 ArkWeb 缺口的移动端浏览器垫片，以及 /wifi-access/api/{status,start,stop,qr,client-caps} 路由与 query_wifi_access 工具。界面（地址/复制/二维码/启停/隧道）由 dsh-pocket 提供，本插件不画界面。",
    "type": "module",
    "main": "lib/index.js",
    "exports": {
        ".": {
            "default": "./lib/index.js"
        },
        "./client": {
            "default": "./lib/client.js"
        },
        "./package.json": "./package.json"
    },
    "dsh": {
        "bundle": {
            "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
        },
        "client": {
            "inject": [
                "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
                "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar",
                "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives"
            ],
            "platform": "web"
        }
    },
    "peerDependencies": {
        "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "^0.1.0-rc.6",
        "react": "^18.2.0"
    },
    "files": [
        "lib",
        "cordis.patch.yml",
        "README.md",
        "LICENSE"
    ],
    "license": "MIT",
    "keywords": [
        "dsh",
        "deepseek-harness",
        "plugin",
        "wifi",
        "lan",
        "proxy",
        "mobile",
        "remote-access"
    ],
    "author": "Ln1m (https://github.com/Ln1m)",
    "repository": {
        "type": "git",
        "url": "git+https://github.com/Ln1m/dsh-wifi-access.git"
    },
    "homepage": "https://github.com/Ln1m/dsh-wifi-access#readme",
    "bugs": {
        "url": "https://github.com/Ln1m/dsh-wifi-access/issues"
    }
}
